_refine_special_details          
; 
Structure was phased by direct methods (Sheldrick, 2015).  Systematic 
conditions suggested the ambiguous space group.  The space group choice 
was confirmed by successful convergence of the full-matrix least-squares 
refinement on F^2^.  The highest peaks in the final difference Fourier 
map were in the vicinity of disordered pyridinium atoms; the final map 
had no other significant features.  A final analysis of variance between 
observed and calculated structure factors showed some dependence on 
amplitude and little dependence on resolution. 
;
